direction: down

ecommerce: E-Commerce System {
  web: Web Application
  api: API Application
  db: Database {
    shape: cylinder
  }
  cache: Cache
  queue: Message Queue {
    shape: queue
  }
}

customer: Customer {
  shape: person
}
payment: Payment Gateway
email: Email Service

customer -> ecommerce.web: Uses
ecommerce.web -> ecommerce.api: Makes API calls to
ecommerce.api -> ecommerce.db: Reads/Writes
ecommerce.api -> ecommerce.cache: Reads/Writes
ecommerce.api -> ecommerce.queue: Publishes messages to
ecommerce.api -> payment: Processes payments via
ecommerce.api -> email: Sends emails via
